<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Key Mentoring Principles=
 I Follow:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Never just give the ans=
wer</strong> - Guide them to discover solutions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Connect every technical=
 decision to business impact</strong> - Banking context matters</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Use real-world scenario=
s</strong> - Abstract examples don't stick</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Encourage experimentati=
on</strong> - But in safe environments</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Build confidence gradua=
lly</strong> - Progressive complexity</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Emphasize critical thin=
king</strong> - Teach them to ask "Why?" and "What if?"</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Make learning collabora=
tive</strong> - We solve problems together</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Focus on fundamentals</=
strong> - Deep understanding beats superficial knowledge</li>
</ol>
